{"id":"8bff810dd710385a","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-primitive-recursive.md","title":"Primitive Recursive Function","display":"df-primitive-recursive — Primitive Recursive Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-primitive-recursive","aliases":["92-df-primitive-recursive"],"display":"df-primitive-recursive — Primitive Recursive Function","depends_on":["[[92-df-pr-function]]"],"source":"第 IV 章附录 pp. 53–54（PDF 70–71）为相关背景；本文为本地计算模型补充","source_status":"本地 PR 成员谓词"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-primitive-recursive"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-primitive-recursive</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-primitive-recursive — Primitive Recursive Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"736154be0fae643a\" href=\"?note=736154be0fae643a\" title=\"92-df-pr-function\">92-df-pr-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 IV 章附录 pp. 53–54（PDF 70–71）为相关背景；本文为本地计算模型补充"},{"key":"source_status","html":"本地 PR 成员谓词"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f : \\mathbb{N}^k \\to \\mathbb{N}\">\\(f : \\mathbb{N}^k \\to \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (arity and function parameter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}\">\\(\\mathrm{PR}\\)</span> (primitive-recursive function class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"736154be0fae643a\" href=\"?note=736154be0fae643a\" title=\"92-df-pr-function\">92-df-pr-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimitiveRecursive}\">\\(\\mathrm{PrimitiveRecursive}\\)</span> (definition-target predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}primitive\\text{-}recursive} \\vdash \\mathrm{PrimitiveRecursive}(f)\\leftrightarrow f\\in\\mathrm{PR}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}primitive\\text{-}recursive} \\vdash \\mathrm{PrimitiveRecursive}(f)\\leftrightarrow f\\in\\mathrm{PR}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimitiveRecursive}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{PrimitiveRecursive}(f)\\)</span>（等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{PR}\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{PR}\\)</span>）: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>是原始递归函数</li>\n<li>原始递归函数由基本函数和有限次运算构造</li>\n<li>基本函数：零函数<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span>、后继<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>、投影<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_i^k\">\\(P_i^k\\)</span></li>\n<li>运算：有类型复合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Comp}_{k,m}\">\\(\\mathrm{Comp}_{k,m}\\)</span>、原始递归 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k\">\\(\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k\\)</span></li>\n<li>原始递归函数都是递归的（可计算）</li>\n<li>但存在递归函数非原始递归（如Ackermann函数）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>该节点只是 PR 类的成员别名；原书 p.48 提及 primitive recursive，但完整闭包定义由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"736154be0fae643a\" href=\"?note=736154be0fae643a\" title=\"92-df-pr-function\">92-df-pr-function</a> 本地给出。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-pr-function","status":"resolved","id":"736154be0fae643a","anchor":